Package: SGPstateData
Title: State Assessment Program Meta-Data for the SGP Package
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-10-31
Authors@R: c(person(given=c("Damian", "W."), family="Betebenner", email="dbetebenner@nciea.org", role=c("aut", "cre")),
